Third-party material in Swarnil Broadcast Kit
=============================================

The kit's own code is MIT — see LICENSE. These arrive with it under their own
terms, and this file exists so LICENSE can stay a verbatim MIT text, which is
what lets GitHub and every other tool recognise it.


libobs (deps/include/libobs)
----------------------------

The OBS Studio headers are vendored so the build reads nothing outside this
folder. They are GPL-2.0. Linking them means a **compiled** plugin is
distributed under the GPL's terms; the source in this repository is MIT and
stays MIT. See deps/README.md.


Geist and Geist Mono (fonts/)
-----------------------------

Geist and Geist Mono (assets/fonts, from the `geist` npm package) are
copyright Vercel, Inc. and licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.


Everything else
---------------

Nothing in this repository is copied from a commercial theme or design system,
and the marks drawn by data/effects/glyph.effect are generic rather than
anybody's trademark. Both are deliberate, and both are what let you use this
inside something you charge for.
